// ┗━━━━━━━━━━━┻━━━━━━━━━━━┻━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━┫   ┣━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━┻━━━━━━━━━━━┻━━━━━━━━━━━┛
//                                     ┃           ┃           ┃           ┃   ┃           ┃           ┃           ┃
//                                     ┗━━━━━━━━━━━┻━━━━━━━━━━━┻━━━━━━━━━━━┛   ┗━━━━━━━━━━━┻━━━━━━━━━━━┻━━━━━━━━━━━┛
 bindings = <
// ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷   ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷

&none &none   &none &kp LA(N9)   &kp LA(N0)   &kp OP_H                &none &none &none &none &none &none
&none &trans  &none &kp N9       &kp N0       &kp OP_J                &none &none &none &none &none &none
&none &none   &none &kp LA(OP_D) &kp LA(OP_L) &kp OP_M                &none &none &none &none &none &none
                    &none        &none        &mt LGUI SPACE          &none &none &to 0
                        >;
                };

        arrow_layer {
        display-name = "ARROW";
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// | TO 0  | none| OMNIPLIDENTR     | OMNIPLIDENTL         | WkfyMirror  |  BSPC     |                   |  @   |  Rycst-MenuCmd  |  none  |  none   |  q    |      |
// | Trans |Trans|          |              |             |  1PassWD  |                   |  #   |  Left           |  UP    |  Down   | Right   |  None |
// | RESET |     |HookCpyLk | HookCpyMDLk  | HookToLink  |   Hook    |                   |  ??ê?? |  $/€          |PGUP|PGDWN|TxTXSearch|TxTXDisable|
//                          |              |   LSHFT     |CMD/return |                   |  SPC |WkfyPrev         |WkfyNext|
            bindings = <
&none       &to 0  &kp OMNIPLIDENTL &kp OMNIPLIDENTR &kp LG(LS(OP_M)) &kp BSPC                    &kp LS(LA(LG(N8))) &none       &kp LA(BSPC)  &kp LG(BSPC) &kp BSPC         &none
&bootloader &trans &kp LCTRL        &kp LALT         &kp LGUI         &kp ONEPWDQUICK             &kp OP_CIR         &kp LEFT    &kp UP        &kp DOWN     &kp RIGHT        &kp TEXTEXOFF
&none       &none  &kp HOOKCPYLK    &kp HOOKCPYMDLK  &kp HOOKTOLINK   &kp LS(F3)                  &kp LS(OP_DLR)     &kp OP_CCED &kp OP_DLR    &trans       &kp TEXTEXSEARCH &none
                                    &kp ESC          &trans           &trans                      &trans             &trans      &trans
            >;
        };

         screen_layer {
         display-name = "SCREEN";
